@page "/SystemLogs"
<style>
.log-intro { background: var(--color-surface); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-left: 4px solid var(--color-primary); padding: 1rem 1.2rem; border-radius: 6px; color: var(--color-text-muted); margin: 1rem 0 1.5rem; }
.log-intro strong { color: var(--color-text); }
.log-intro code { background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--color-surface), var(--color-text) 8%); color: var(--color-text); padding: 0.05rem 0.35rem; border-radius: 3px; font-size: 0.88rem; }
.log-window { background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--color-bg), var(--color-text) 4%); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; margin: 1rem 0 1.5rem; }
.log-window-bar { background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--color-surface), var(--color-text) 6%); padding: 0.55rem 0.95rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); }
.log-window-bar .dot { width: 11px; height: 11px; border-radius: 50%; background: #dc2626; }
.log-window-bar .dot.y { background: #ca8a04; }
.log-window-bar .dot.g { background: #059669; }
.log-window-bar .title { margin-left: 0.5rem; color: var(--color-text); }
.log-content { padding: 1rem 1.2rem; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--color-text); line-height: 1.55; overflow-x: auto; white-space: pre; }
.log-content .ts { color: var(--color-text-muted); }
.log-content .lvl-info { color: #1d4ed8; }
.log-content .lvl-ok { color: #047857; }
.log-content .lvl-warn { color: #b45309; }
.log-content .key { color: #6b21a8; }
.log-content .str { color: #92400e; }
.log-content .num { color: #c2410c; }
.log-content .bool { color: #1e40af; }
.log-content .sep { color: var(--color-text-muted); }
body:has(.theme-dark:checked) .log-content .lvl-info { color: #60a5fa; }
body:has(.theme-dark:checked) .log-content .lvl-ok { color: #34d399; }
body:has(.theme-dark:checked) .log-content .lvl-warn { color: #facc15; }
body:has(.theme-dark:checked) .log-content .key { color: #c084fc; }
body:has(.theme-dark:checked) .log-content .str { color: #fde68a; }
body:has(.theme-dark:checked) .log-content .num { color: #fb923c; }
body:has(.theme-dark:checked) .log-content .bool { color: #60a5fa; }
@@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  body:has(.theme-system:checked) .log-content .lvl-info { color: #60a5fa; }
  body:has(.theme-system:checked) .log-content .lvl-ok { color: #34d399; }
  body:has(.theme-system:checked) .log-content .lvl-warn { color: #facc15; }
  body:has(.theme-system:checked) .log-content .key { color: #c084fc; }
  body:has(.theme-system:checked) .log-content .str { color: #fde68a; }
  body:has(.theme-system:checked) .log-content .num { color: #fb923c; }
  body:has(.theme-system:checked) .log-content .bool { color: #60a5fa; }
}
.log-section { margin-top: 2rem; }
.log-section h2 { color: var(--color-text); font-size: 1.1rem; margin: 0 0 0.5rem; }
.log-section p { color: var(--color-text-muted); margin: 0 0 1rem; }
.log-section a, .log-table a, .log-intro a { color: var(--color-primary); text-decoration: underline; }
.log-section a:hover { color: var(--color-primary-dark); }
p a, ol a, ul a, li a { text-decoration: underline; }
.log-section code { background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--color-surface), var(--color-text) 8%); color: var(--color-text); padding: 0.05rem 0.35rem; border-radius: 3px; font-size: 0.88rem; }
.log-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; background: var(--color-surface); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; margin: 1rem 0; }
.log-table th, .log-table td { padding: 0.65rem 0.95rem; text-align: left; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); font-size: 0.88rem; vertical-align: top; }
.log-table th { background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--color-surface), var(--color-text) 6%); color: var(--color-text); font-weight: 600; }
.log-table td { color: var(--color-text); }
.log-table td.mono { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 0.83rem; word-break: break-word; }
.log-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
</style>
<h1>System Event Logs</h1>
<p>Every action on a PrTask transaction is recorded as an immutable, append-only event in the platform's audit log. The events for a single task form a complete, tamper-evident chronology from posting through paid delivery. The log excerpt below is the production format, populated with the same example transaction (PR cli/cli#1) used on the <a href="/Receipt?pr=https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/1">delivery receipt page</a> and the <a href="/ConfirmationEmails">confirmation emails page</a>.</p>
<div class="log-intro"><strong>Schema:</strong> each event contains <code>ts</code> (RFC3339 UTC timestamp), <code>level</code>, <code>event</code>, <code>actor</code> (the user whose action produced the event), <code>taskId</code>, and an event-specific payload. Records are persisted to the AuditLogEntity table and retained for a minimum of 5 years per Philippine BSP / BIR / AMLA requirements.</div>
